[[File:Lesser Dog (Beta 17.0).png|thumb|234x234px|Beta 17.0]]
Lesser Dog went through quite a lot of changes. It started out with 3/4 and costed 5G. This was reduced to 4G in '''Alpha 3.2''', but was returned to 5G in '''Beta 3.2 '''and raised further to 6G in '''Beta 4.3'''.

'''Beta 4.8''' increased its ATK from 3 to 4 and '''Beta 17.0''' increased its HP from 4 to 5, while also changing its Magic to a Dust, making it possible to reduce the cost of 7 cards in your hand at most rather than 6, at the cost of it being vulnerable to Silence. '''Beta 46.1''' decreased its HP back to 4.

